diff --git a/MODERN_MOONBIT.md b/MODERN_MOONBIT.md
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..acf6ec24c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/MODERN_MOONBIT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Dewdrop compatibility patch
+
+Dewdrop owner decision, 2026-10-31: use Moon 0.1.20261023,
+moonc v0.10.17+d971670cd, and bundled core 0.10.17+d971670cd for now.
+
+Replace removed Result predicate methods with equivalent constructor patterns.
+Use Float::reinterpret_from_int/from_uint for f32 bit casts. No algorithm or
+snapshot changes. This local commit stays on top of Dewdrop's pinned revision
+1b237952167f582abd492aec27adf10c5a6c9e60.
